cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "5LTEP-L3: 5L-TEP Layer 3 Anomaly Detection Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Layer 3 (Anomaly Detection) of the Five-Layer
  Trust Engineering Pyramid (5L-TEP) for open government data: an ensemble of
  statistical and learned detectors with a Page-Hinkley drift test, a local
  LLM-as-a-Judge (Ollama) that classifies each anomaly, and a human-in-the-loop
  review through GitHub Issues. Declarative profiles adapt it to other CKAN
  portals, datasets and data cuts.
type: software
